      "created_at": "2013-02-09T21:11:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Set-Up is something that happens pre-game, so it doesn't have an impact on the actual turns, so each will play as normal. So Set-Up would occur, then villians would do their regular stuff they would do on any other turn.</p>",
