      "created_at": "2013-02-10T22:02:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, Voss is normally like that - you can get pounded by Minions in the first turn, and then have to quickly obliterate them before they get to do it again next round :D. Dawn is much the same (but more annoying, especially if she starts with, say, Tears, who forces discards).</p><p>And then there's the Matriarch... :P</p>",
